  "generated_text": "To compute $\\dbinom{50}{2}$, we use the formula for combinations:\n\\[\n\\dbinom{n}{k} = \\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}\n\\]\nwhere $n = 50$ and $k = 2$. Plugging in these values, we get:\n\\[\n\\dbinom{50}{2} = \\frac{50!}{2!(50-2)!} = \\frac{50!}{2! \\cdot 48!}\n\\]\nSimplifying the factorials, we have:\n\\[\n\\dbinom{50}{2} = \\frac{50 \\times 49 \\times 48!}{2 \\times 1 \\times 48!} = \\frac{50 \\times 49}{2}\n\\]\nCalculating the product gives:\n\\[\n\\dbinom{50}{2} = \\frac{2450}{2} = 1225\n\\]\nThus, $\\dbinom{50}{2} = \\boxed{1225}$.",
